00:44:07.310 --> 00:44:10.670
and everything, the
government sends you a paper

00:44:10.670 --> 00:44:13.850
that says this chemical is now banned.

00:44:13.850 --> 00:44:16.180
For a substitute you can use,

00:44:16.180 --> 00:44:18.202
and they'll give three to five things.

00:44:18.202 --> 00:44:19.330
- [Mark] They tell you what to use.

00:44:19.330 --> 00:44:21.083
- Yeah, but this guy,

00:44:22.960 --> 00:44:24.830
like I said, it was
very lucrative for him.

00:44:24.830 --> 00:44:27.100
He was abiding by all the
rules the state of California

00:44:27.100 --> 00:44:32.100
said to him, but his orders
were coming from out of state

00:44:32.100 --> 00:44:35.377
and other states were
having the same issue, too.

00:44:35.377 --> 00:44:36.280
A lot of people didn't know it

00:44:36.280 --> 00:44:39.010
because it was like they
were keeping it under wraps.

00:44:39.010 --> 00:44:43.943
But I think about all 50 states
now have an issue with it.

00:44:45.879 --> 00:44:50.040
And so you got a company in Detroit,

00:44:50.040 --> 00:44:52.730
they want $8,000 worth of product

00:44:52.730 --> 00:44:55.520
because they doing so well out there.

00:44:55.520 --> 00:44:56.353
They spend they $8,000.

00:44:56.353 --> 00:45:00.047
You got a company in Florida,
they wanna spend $20,000.

00:45:00.047 --> 00:45:02.860
You got these people over
here in Des Moines, Idaho,

00:45:02.860 --> 00:45:05.090
they got 50,000 they wanna spend.

00:45:05.090 --> 00:45:07.480
So money is coming to
him, left, hand over foot,

00:45:07.480 --> 00:45:09.980
hand over feet from legal tobacco shops

00:45:10.870 --> 00:45:12.620
that are selling the spice

00:45:12.620 --> 00:45:14.920
and he's a legal producer of the shit,

00:45:14.920 --> 00:45:19.920
but his flaw was chemicals
that are banned in California

00:45:21.340 --> 00:45:23.810
that you bought the ones you
can use, don't necessarily mean

00:45:23.810 --> 00:45:25.610
they're not banned in another state.

00:45:27.020 --> 00:45:29.540
So he's mailing the
stuff out to the people,

00:45:29.540 --> 00:45:31.253
just conducting business as usual.

00:45:32.320 --> 00:45:36.540
And they came and raided the warehouse,

00:45:36.540 --> 00:45:39.063
snatched him out his house in Calabasas,

00:45:40.530 --> 00:45:44.263
froze his bank accounts, arrested him

00:45:46.070 --> 00:45:48.620
and told him he was
under arrest for the sale

00:45:48.620 --> 00:45:52.243
and distribution of synthetic
marijuana for spice.

00:45:53.270 --> 00:45:55.900
And he was like, that's
impossible, man, I run the factory.

00:45:55.900 --> 00:45:57.990
I'm legally federally licensed

00:45:57.990 --> 00:46:00.400
to do this, this, that and
the other, this is bullshit!

00:46:00.400 --> 00:46:04.793
So when he go to court, they
tell him, the deal is 20 years.

00:46:07.350 --> 00:46:08.183
He was like, 20 years?

00:46:08.183 --> 00:46:09.200
I'm not doing 20 years!

00:46:09.200 --> 00:46:12.640
Mind you, he's 23 years
old, no, 26 at the time.

00:46:12.640 --> 00:46:15.713
23 is when he opened the company,
26 years old at the time.

00:46:17.390 --> 00:46:18.930
And he's like, Hell no, I'm legal.

00:46:18.930 --> 00:46:20.220
I'm not doing...

00:46:20.220 --> 00:46:22.211
He goes and hires him
the best lawyer he can

00:46:22.211 --> 00:46:23.044
and everything else,

00:46:23.044 --> 00:46:24.460
but it was nothing he could do about it.

00:46:24.460 --> 00:46:25.803
So he fought the case.

00:46:26.660 --> 00:46:28.730
And everything he was trying
to say that he was going to use

00:46:28.730 --> 00:46:30.970
for his defense failed against him.

00:46:30.970 --> 00:46:34.660
So they ended up giving him
30 years in the federal pen.

00:46:34.660 --> 00:46:36.010
Stripped him of all his money,

00:46:36.010 --> 00:46:37.843
all his cars, everything, gone.

00:46:42.621 --> 00:46:46.621
And like I say, I took a
hiatus for three months

00:46:48.330 --> 00:46:51.363
because it was I was going
through too much mentally.

00:46:53.150 --> 00:46:56.240
I wasn't getting along with
any of my kids' mothers anymore

00:46:56.240 --> 00:46:58.280
because it was like somebody
started undercutting

00:46:58.280 --> 00:47:00.497
my business at the time.

00:47:00.497 --> 00:47:02.240
And it was a gentleman that I've known

00:47:02.240 --> 00:47:03.340
for more than 10 years.

00:47:03.340 --> 00:47:06.387
At one point, he was even
taking care of my kids for me.

00:47:07.830 --> 00:47:10.850
Cut into my money really
bad, so I went from making

00:47:10.850 --> 00:47:13.673
about $800 a day to making $100 a day.

00:47:14.618 --> 00:47:16.083
And it really affected me.

00:47:17.657 --> 00:47:22.657
And one of my mentors from
childhood that knows both of us

00:47:22.950 --> 00:47:26.710
and he told me the best
way as he possibly could.

00:47:26.710 --> 00:47:28.113
He said, "It's a sidewalk.

00:47:29.180 --> 00:47:31.357
"You can't stop what
goes on on a sidewalk,

00:47:31.357 --> 00:47:35.437
"you can't claim anything
'cause it's not yours."

00:47:36.370 --> 00:47:38.400
I said it's fucked up that
your friend is the one

00:47:38.400 --> 00:47:39.687
that's doing this to you.

00:47:41.260 --> 00:47:43.710
He said, "But, now you
know he's not your friend.

00:47:45.547 --> 00:47:47.643
"So you have a choice to make yourself.

00:47:48.507 --> 00:47:52.147
"You say, do you do something
that's gonna cause bad vibes

00:47:52.147 --> 00:47:54.287
"and retaliation to yourself

00:47:54.287 --> 00:47:59.067
"or do you just continue to be you?"

00:48:01.016 --> 00:48:02.933
I tell him, I'm gonna continue to be me.

00:48:04.010 --> 00:48:04.860
So I got well.

00:48:06.040 --> 00:48:09.970
This caused rifts between
me and my son's mother

00:48:09.970 --> 00:48:13.670
because they was agreeing,
now they finally all agreed

00:48:13.670 --> 00:48:16.483
to bring my kids to my
mother's house every weekend.

00:48:19.540 --> 00:48:22.730
And kids was all getting brand new stuff,

00:48:22.730 --> 00:48:24.380
everything that they needed.

00:48:24.380 --> 00:48:26.863
I was like I was a good father once again.

00:48:28.010 --> 00:48:31.910
Even though what I was doing
wasn't completely legal

00:48:31.910 --> 00:48:33.500
or illegal at the time

00:48:33.500 --> 00:48:38.500
'cause they hadn't made that
law up yet, I was at peace.

00:48:39.080 --> 00:48:40.853
And then that got snatched from me.

00:48:43.091 --> 00:48:44.991
And I fell behind in my child support.

00:48:46.820 --> 00:48:48.140
Baby mother's not understanding.

00:48:48.140 --> 00:48:50.220
Why I didn't do this, why I didn't do that

00:48:50.220 --> 00:48:51.743
and I'm just trying to tell
them, y'all don't understand,

00:48:51.743 --> 00:48:54.630
I don't wanna be here no more.

00:48:54.630 --> 00:48:55.767
I just want some peace.

00:48:55.767 --> 00:48:58.433
I need to do what I wanna do.

00:48:59.290 --> 00:49:01.530
My two friends had just passed away

00:49:01.530 --> 00:49:03.360
and I was sitting there and
I was thinking to myself,

00:49:03.360 --> 00:49:08.360
I really been on this corner
almost, downtown period,

00:49:08.540 --> 00:49:10.830
about six, seven years that
I could have really just

00:49:10.830 --> 00:49:14.200
the same struggle I did,
I could've went to college

00:49:14.200 --> 00:49:17.210
and had my degree and
then two years on the job

00:49:17.210 --> 00:49:18.373
that I had trained for.

00:49:19.460 --> 00:49:21.820
And then that's when I
realized I had a conversation

00:49:21.820 --> 00:49:22.653
with my mother and she was like,

00:49:22.653 --> 00:49:24.670
"I'm 77 years on my birthday

00:49:25.717 --> 00:49:27.643
"that I don't wanna be
in California no more.

00:49:27.643 --> 00:49:28.793
"I wanna go back to Alabama."

00:49:28.793 --> 00:49:30.767
She said, "But I can't
'cause I got your kids."

00:49:32.550 --> 00:49:35.350
And that's when I said I
gotta get myself back reunited

00:49:35.350 --> 00:49:36.183
with my mother.

00:49:37.553 --> 00:49:40.050
And I spent that time around my mother

00:49:40.050 --> 00:49:42.387
until she finally looked at me and said,

00:49:42.387 --> 00:49:43.517
"Don't you think you might wanna go out

00:49:43.517 --> 00:49:47.377
"and sell some dope, do something
other than be right here?"

00:49:49.150 --> 00:49:51.570
And I had to take it
for what it was worth.

00:49:51.570 --> 00:49:53.623
I mean, she dealt with me for a month,

00:49:54.947 --> 00:49:58.150
during the cold rainy part of the winter.

00:49:58.150 --> 00:50:00.960
She said I rose her
electricity bill up to $700

00:50:01.970 --> 00:50:03.285
fucking with them floor heaters.

00:50:03.285 --> 00:50:05.464
You know that shit'll do it to you.

00:50:05.464 --> 00:50:10.303
And I ended up right back
down here all over again.

